+
+    Two-shot mode partitions whole rows; the gather reads directly into the
+    norm body, preserving the stock rank-order sum and BF16 rounding.
+    Borrow the existing push plane on its owning stream; callers must not run
+    another operation on this plane concurrently. Geometry and arithmetic match
